step 50 "@pulse until 400 is DEAD!!"
pulses 54
out god "\n\rThe lizard's bite misses Rambler.\n\rRambler's slash misses the lizard.\n\rThe duck's peck misses the lizard.\n\rYeoman's slash mauls the lizard.\n\rYeoman's slash mauls the lizard.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe lizard's bite misses Rambler.\n\rThe duck's peck misses the lizard.\n\rRambler's slash hits the lizard.\n\rYeoman's slash hits the lizard.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe lizard's bite misses Rambler.\n\rThe lizard screams and attacks!\n\rThe lizard's bite misses Yeoman.\n\rThe lizard's bite misses Yeoman.\n\rThe duck's peck misses the lizard.\n\rRambler's slash misses the lizard.\n\rYeoman's slash misses the lizard.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe lizard's bite misses Rambler.\n\rThe lizard's bite misses Yeoman.\n\rThe duck's peck grazes the lizard.\n\rRambler's slash misses the lizard.\n\rYeoman's slash misses the lizard.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe lizard's bite misses Rambler.\n\rThe lizard's bite misses Yeoman.\n\rThe duck's peck misses the lizard.\n\rRambler's slash decimates the lizard.\n\rThe lizard is DEAD!!\n\rRambler is zapped by wild flowers.\n\rThe lizard's leg is sliced from her dead body.\n\r\n\r<100hp 100m 100mv> \xff\xf9"
out dec "\n\rYou hear something's death cry.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 105mv> \xff\xf9"
out yeo "\n\rThe lizard's bite misses Rambler.\n\rRambler's slash misses the lizard.\n\rThe duck's peck misses the lizard.\n\rYour slash mauls the lizard.\n\rYour slash mauls the lizard.\n\rThe lizard has some big nasty wounds and scratches. \n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe lizard's bite misses Rambler.\n\rThe duck's peck misses the lizard.\n\rRambler's slash hits the lizard.\n\rYour slash hits the lizard.\n\rThe lizard looks pretty hurt. \n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe lizard's bite misses Rambler.\n\rThe lizard screams and attacks!\n\rThe lizard's bite misses you.\n\rThe lizard's bite misses you.\n\rThe duck's peck misses the lizard.\n\rRambler's slash misses the lizard.\n\rYour slash misses the lizard.\n\rThe lizard looks pretty hurt. \n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe lizard's bite misses Rambler.\n\rThe lizard's bite misses you.\n\rThe duck's peck grazes the lizard.\n\rRambler's slash misses the lizard.\n\rYour slash misses the lizard.\n\rThe lizard is in awful condition. \n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe lizard's bite misses Rambler.\n\rThe lizard's bite misses you.\n\rThe duck's peck misses the lizard.\n\rRambler's slash decimates the lizard.\n\rThe lizard is DEAD!!\n\rRambler is zapped by wild flowers.\n\rYou receive 21 experience points.\n\rThe lizard's leg is sliced from her dead body.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
out ram "\n\rThe lizard's bite misses you.\n\rYour slash misses the lizard.\n\rThe duck's peck misses the lizard.\n\rYeoman's slash mauls the lizard.\n\rYeoman's slash mauls the lizard.\n\rThe lizard has some big nasty wounds and scratches. \n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe lizard's bite misses you.\n\rThe duck's peck misses the lizard.\n\rYour slash hits the lizard.\n\rYeoman's slash hits the lizard.\n\rThe lizard looks pretty hurt. \n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe lizard's bite misses you.\n\rThe lizard screams and attacks!\n\rThe lizard's bite misses Yeoman.\n\rThe lizard's bite misses Yeoman.\n\rThe duck's peck misses the lizard.\n\rYour slash misses the lizard.\n\rYeoman's slash misses the lizard.\n\rThe lizard looks pretty hurt. \n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe lizard's bite misses you.\n\rThe lizard's bite misses Yeoman.\n\rThe duck's peck grazes the lizard.\n\rYour slash misses the lizard.\n\rYeoman's slash misses the lizard.\n\rThe lizard is in awful condition. \n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9\n\rThe lizard's bite misses you.\n\rThe lizard's bite misses Yeoman.\n\rThe duck's peck misses the lizard.\n\rYour slash decimates the lizard.\n\rThe lizard is DEAD!!\n\rYou receive 40 experience points.\n\rYou are zapped by wild flowers.\n\rThe lizard's leg is sliced from her dead body.\n\r\n\r<29hp 102m 106mv> \xff\xf9"
